    "title": "Baylor Baseball Coach Zach Dillon Previews Texas State - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Garrett Ross ,\n1 days ago Opening weekend could not have scripted a more electrifying start for the Baylor baseball program. Behind a historic debut from newcomer Tyce Armstrong, the Bears (3-0) surged into the national spotlight after Armstrong blasted three grand slams in his first collegiate weekend, a feat that left even veteran assistant coach Zach Dillon searching for words. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
